// visibility withdrawal — consumed-continuity is absolute. chora-sharing owns
// the AtomUsageGrant table (the audit record of every reuse, written at
// snapshot/arm time per ADR-229 D2), which makes it the authoritative
// registry of granted consumers. When a withdrawal event
// (reuse_visibility_changed.v1 narrowing, or atom.archived.v1) strands >=1
