// consumes it and materialises the SINGLETON orphan edition (per atom +
// last-published-revision), answering with atom.orphan_created.v1, on which
// sharing repoints the stranded grants. Cross-DB queries forbidden — this
// two-leg saga is the only coupling.
//
// A withdrawal that strands ZERO grants emits nothing here (creation still
// checks its own in-domain collection entries locally at withdrawal time).
